<title>POLAND: Atlantis starts trade 25 pct above issue.</title>
<headline>Atlantis starts trade 25 pct above issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading firm Atlantis SA started bourse trade on the main market at 7.5 zlotys, 25 percent above issue.</p>
<p>Atlantis debut, originally planned for Wednesday was delayed after the bourse suspended its trade because the company informed about a significant investment despite a ban on such announcements during bourse trading.</p>
<p>In April the firm's five-million-share issue, priced at six zlotys per share, was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
